# Google Identity Services — UI personalization login (client-side, no backend).
# Create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID (type: Web application) in Google Cloud Console,
# then add this site's origins under "Authorized JavaScript origins":
#   http://localhost:5173  (dev)  + your production origin (e.g. https://<user>.github.io)
# The client_id is public; no client_secret is needed for this flow.
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the value, then restart `npm run dev`.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=